END

SCRIPT:transferControl
"If the Sheriff sells this wall hub, he/she will voluntarily and irreversibly transfer control of all units to a computer player and enter observer mode. This behavior will not affect the progress of the battle. "
END

SCRIPT:sheriffEliminated
"The Sheriff has been eliminated. "
END

SCRIPT:renegadeEliminated
"The Renegade has been eliminated. "
END

SCRIPT:deputyEliminated
"The Deputy has been eliminated. "
END

SCRIPT:outlawEliminated
"A Outlaw has been eliminated. "
END

SCRIPT:sheriffWin
"The Sheriff and his Deputy win. "
END

SCRIPT:renegadeWin
"The Renegade wins. "
END

SCRIPT:nobodyWin
"Game over. Nobody wins. "
END

SCRIPT:outlawWin
"The Outlaws win. "
END

SCRIPT:debugCode
"Random int: "
END

SCRIPT:PowerCoreCalibrate
"Reactors Unstable For: "
END

SCRIPT:tutorial__1
"Welcome to Red Alert 3 "Bang!" gamemode. "
END

SCRIPT:tutorial__2
"In this gamemode, each player takes one of the following roles: \nSheriff x 1, Deputy Sheriff x 1, Outlaws x 2, and Renegade x 1. "
END

SCRIPT:tutorial__3
"You need to check the text corresponding to the revealed corner of the minimap to know your role. "
END

SCRIPT:tutorial__4
"The objective of the game is different for every role: "
END

SCRIPT:tutorial__5
"The Outlaws must kill the Sheriff; "
END

SCRIPT:tutorial__6
"The Sheriff and his Deputy must kill the Outlaws and the Renegade; "
END

SCRIPT:tutorial__7
"The Renegade must kill all the characters with the Sheriff being the last one dead. "
END

SCRIPT:tutorial__8
"Before the entire army is annihilated, the Sheriff should not exit the game by any means other than selling the wall hub. "
END

SCRIPT:tutorial__9
"Learn more on github.com/qingchen239/Red-Alert-3-Bang-Gamemode . "
END

SCRIPT:tutorial__10
"Good luck, have fun. "
END

