"强风折秀木，铡刀断王头！"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_ATTACK_8
"What else can we do? Kill!"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_ATTACK_8?chinese
"怎么办，只有杀！"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_ATTACK_9
"This strike will leave your body whole."
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_ATTACK_9?chinese
"这一击，留你全尸"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_COUNTER_TITLE
"Counterattack"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_COUNTER_TITLE?chinese
"反击"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_COUNTER_1
"The Lord is in peril. Today we restore the realm!"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_COUNTER_1?chinese
"救主危难，今日匡扶汉室！"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_COUNTER_2
"Fear not, my Lord. Zhao Zilong of Changshan is here!"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_COUNTER_2?chinese
"主公莫急，常山赵子龙来也！"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_COUNTER_3
"If I am falsely accused of regicide, I may as well make it true!"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_COUNTER_3?chinese
"既诬我弑君，那便坐实了这罪名！"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_COUNTER_4
"You rabble are no match for a single exchange."
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_COUNTER_4?chinese
"歪瓜裂枣，非我一合之敌"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_COUNTER_5
"Marked men waiting for the blade, and you dare invade my land?"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_COUNTER_5?chinese
"尔等插标卖首，也敢来犯吾境？"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_COUNTER_6
"Cut off my income and I will cut you down."
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_COUNTER_6?chinese
"妈的，敢断我财路就宰了你"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_COUNTER_7
"The splendor of Jiangdong will not suffer fools."
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_COUNTER_7?chinese
"锦秀江东，岂容小丑横行"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_COUNTER_8
"Warlords? A herd awaiting slaughter."
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_COUNTER_8?chinese
"群雄？呵，一群待宰猪羊罢了！"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_COUNTER_9
"Stop! I do not want the giant electric baton!"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_COUNTER_9?chinese
"快停下！我不要大电棒子"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_REFLECT_TITLE
"Reflection"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_REFLECT_TITLE?chinese
"感慨"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_REFLECT_1
"Let heaven distinguish the loyal from the treacherous!"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_REFLECT_1?chinese
"请苍天辩忠奸！"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_REFLECT_2
"My mistake was mercy. I should have torn out the roots!"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_REFLECT_2?chinese
"某错在太过仁慈，未斩草除根！"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_REFLECT_3
"You skulk in the shadows. Are you plotting rebellion?"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_REFLECT_3?chinese
"鬼鬼祟祟，形迹可疑，可是密谋造反？"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_REFLECT_4
"War permits deception. You have no cause to resent your fate!"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_REFLECT_4?chinese
"兵法云‘兵不厌诈’，阁下死的不怨呐！"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_REFLECT_5
"The granaries of Wuchao are consumed by flame!"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_REFLECT_5?chinese
"乌巢粮仓，付之一炬！"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_REFLECT_6
"Rebels surge and the capital is besieged. Loyal forces, make haste."
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_REFLECT_6?chinese
"贼势汹涌，京都困顿，勤王者速行。"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_REFLECT_7
"Chang'an has fallen and the court flees west. The protector shall be supreme general!"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_REFLECT_7?chinese
"长安沦陷，川蜀西狩，护驾者当为上将军！"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_REFLECT_8
"Phoenix and Vermilion Bird dance; a million White Tigers march in gold. Who can withstand them?"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_REFLECT_8?chinese
"凤凰朱雀齐舞，金甲白虎百万，试问安何当之！"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_PEACE_TITLE
"Peace"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_PEACE_TITLE?chinese
"和平"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_PEACE_1
"Let us farm, mine, and develop in peace."
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_PEACE_1?chinese
"屯田开矿，我们一起安稳发育可好？"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_PEACE_2
"Raise walls and deepen moats. We seek no conquest."
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_PEACE_2?chinese
"高墙深池，不做攻伐之举。"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_PEACE_3
"Vengeance never ends. Hear me: lay down arms and make peace!"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_PEACE_3?chinese
"冤冤相报何时了，我有一言：停兵休战！"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_PEACE_4
"Why should Loyalist and Traitor destroy each other? Turn weapons into peace!"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_PEACE_4?chinese
"忠内何苦自相残，立化干戈为玉帛！"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_PEACE_5
"Rumors kill the heart. The Lord must not believe them."
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_PEACE_5?chinese
"流言诛心，主公万不可信"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_PEACE_6
"Belief or doubt rests with the Lord. What more need I say?"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_PEACE_6?chinese
"信与不信，皆在主公一念，吾又何须多言？"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_PEACE_7
"I seek no endless conquest, only unity and prosperity for the people."
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_PEACE_7?chinese
"征伐天下并非我意，只愿四海归一，生民蕃息。"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_PEACE_8
"You skulk in the shadows. Are you plotting rebellion?"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_PEACE_8?chinese
"鬼鬼祟祟，形迹可疑，可是密谋造反？"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_PEACE_9
"Today's defeat was not a failure of arms, but the denial of heaven's hour!"
END

SCRIPT:BANG_SENTENCE_PEACE_9?chinese
"今日之败，非战之罪，乃天时不予！"
END
